      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report the observations of three patients with myocarditis. The first one with chest pain, the second one with a pseudo-infarct presentation and the third one with a cardiogenic shock. We discuss the different anatomo-clinical presentations of myocarditis, the diagnosis, the indications of endomyocardial biopsies and the prognosis of this pathology."},
